# ── ALICE environment configuration ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env` (never commit `.env`) and fill in for your environment.

# ── LLM access (OpenAI-compatible endpoint) ──────────────────────────────────
# ALICE and ARIA make ALL LLM calls through an OpenAI-compatible endpoint
# (any OpenAI-compatible gateway or router works). Point OPENAI_BASE_URL at it.
# Do NOT point application code at a provider URL directly — the endpoint is
# configured here, never hardcoded.
#
# Example (local gateway on port 20128) — uncomment and set:
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=http://localhost:20128/v1

# API key forwarded to the endpoint. Some gateways ignore it, but the OpenAI SDK
# still requires a value. Use any non-secret placeholder for local dev.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=local-dev

# Model selection. Leave unset to use OmniRoute's zero-config "auto" router.
# Never hardcode a provider model name in code — override here if you must pin one.
# ALICE_MODEL=auto

# ── Server ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Port the API/full app is served on (default 8787).
# PORT=8787
